# Vault Maintenance

When editing notes in this vault:

- Use consistent YAML frontmatter: `type`, `tags`, `owner`, `updated`, `status`
- Types: `context`, `preference`, `stack`, `pattern`
- Link related notes with Obsidian wikilinks: `[[Preferences/AI Behavior]]`, `[[Stacks/Bun Monolith]]`
- Do not duplicate content from `Karpathy/` — link to it instead
- Stack profiles describe architecture types, not individual repos
- Update the `updated` date when making substantive edits
